    </node>
    <node id="Personal Data">
      <data key="d0">Personal Data</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Personal data refers to information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual, which must be collected and processed lawfully under regulations like GDPR.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-affbd5dbcf34ebe169fa07a29874fc52</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756582247</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Consent">
      <data key="d0">Consent</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Consent is a lawful basis for processing personal data, where individuals must agree to the use of their data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-affbd5dbcf34ebe169fa07a29874fc52</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756582247</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Art. 46(2)(c)">
      <data key="d0">Art. 46(2)(c)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Art. 46(2)(c) refers to a specific article in legal texts which discusses conditions related to data processing and transfer requirements under GDPR.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-affbd5dbcf34ebe169fa07a29874fc52</data>
